    <summary>Terminal music player — shuffles and plays a directory of audio files</summary>
    <description>
# derpy

A terminal music player with an opinion: shuffle everything, earmark what's hitting right, let the list expire.

- Recursively scans a directory for audio files and shuffles them
- Minimal TUI: current track, progress bar, nothing else
- Filter playback by keyword expression
- [E] earmark, [P] post to Nostr, [D] delete from disk
- ListenBrainz scrobbling support

## Supported formats

MP3, FLAC, WAV, OGG, M4A, AAC
